### ==============================================================================
### BO TEST API XAC THUC VA PHAN QUYEN JWT (REST CLIENT VS CODE)
### ==============================================================================
@BASE_URL = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Dang ky tai khoan Khach hang hop le (Ky vong 201 Created)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nguyen Van Khach",
  "email": "khach1@gmail.com",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Thu dang ky trung Email (Ky vong 409 Conflict)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nguyen Van Khach Trung",
  "email": "khach1@gmail.com",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Thu dang ky sai dinh dang so dien thoai (Ky vong 400 Bad Request)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Loi So Dien Thoai",
  "email": "loi_sdt@gmail.com",
  "phone": "12345",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Dang nhap voi tai khoan Admin mac dinh (Ky vong 200 OK + tra ve accessToken va set cookie)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@shop.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Luu token cua Admin vao bien de dung cho request tiep theo
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 5. Lay thong tin tai khoan hien tai bang token vua dang nhap (Ky vong 200 OK)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Thu goi lay thong tin khi thieu token (Ky vong 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/me

### 7. Lam moi token bang Refresh Token trong Cookie (Ky vong 200 OK + cap accessToken moi)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/refresh

### 8. Dang xuat he thong (Ky vong 200 OK + xoa token database va cookie)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/auth/logout